  - m_Id: 27568915591516160
    m_Key: That message I got while I was sleeping in the car....
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27569054854991872
    m_Key: "I couldn\u2019t sleep peacefully because of it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27569120613289984
    m_Key: "I still don\u2019t know who sent it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27569154608123904
    m_Key: But it mentioned Adel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27569202452549632
    m_Key: "I\u2019ve wanted an excuse to come back here for years."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27569247839113216
    m_Key: Guess I finally got one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27569334199832576
    m_Key: Al-Sarab...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27569373928280064
    m_Key: This place carries memories I can never forget.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27569417788116992
    m_Key: If whoever sent that message really knows something about Adel...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27569462746861568
    m_Key: I need to find out what.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27569493688242176
    m_Key: People playing soccer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27569523266473984
    m_Key: Whispers of the neighbors
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27569571438055424
    m_Key: But sometimes... you can hear people ruin the peace by their cars
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27569652375539712
    m_Key: And I honestly don't respect them but hey.. what to do right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27569758130720768
    m_Key: All i'm wishing for... is that everything goes okay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27589643942547456
    m_Key: Barber Shop?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27589743213334528
    m_Key: This is where im heading then...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49671519486136320
    m_Key: The door should be opened now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49675856169979904
    m_Key: There might be something important before I leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 54718436247130112
    m_Key: New Entry 7
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 54718542845366272
    m_Key: This drawing style is very familiar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 54718841156849664
    m_Key: H
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 54723337136164864
    m_Key: Maybe a child used it to find his way to home
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57359383967617024
    m_Key: I can't go there!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59784448034263040
    m_Key: Ah man... what the hell just happened?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59784975992279040
    m_Key: Do I focus on the crash... or how thick this fog is?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59785487449903104
    m_Key: "Great. Even the phone isn\u2019t working\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59785615820771328
    m_Key: "Weird\u2026 why did my watch stop?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59785735626870784
    m_Key: Heeeey watch where you're going!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59785794120634368
    m_Key: "What?? Who\u2019s there??"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59785849372200960
    m_Key: "Haven\u2019t I seen that backpack before?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59785926950047744
    m_Key: I have to chase him!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62344030304653312
    m_Key: This isn't normal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62344963759591424
    m_Key: Am I in a dream or something?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62345153904168960
    m_Key: Man...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62345229959483392
    m_Key: What the hell did I walk into?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62345289019478016
    m_Key: "Maybe\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62345336461250560
    m_Key: Maybe this is what I get
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62345431466430464
    m_Key: "Who knows\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62345668507521024
    m_Key: Maybe I died in that crash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62345686920515584
    m_Key: No...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62345888729452544
    m_Key: "I can\u2019t stop"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62345936582266880
    m_Key: Not right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64574890445688832
    m_Key: '" We have what you need "'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64575078530863104
    m_Key: '" Bring back the key you took from us "'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64575200551555072
    m_Key: '" And this time... answer our question "'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 82295794478927872
    m_Key: Seriously what's going on here?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 82335108210413568
    m_Key: What are these markers?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 82335379539939328
    m_Key: Might be worth checking it out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 82377214354313216
    m_Key: This is map for sarab
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87726628719611904
    m_Key: Must kill them first!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89937341936619520
    m_Key: Is that you, Adel??
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95071864571613184
    m_Key: I have to find the kid first
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95086058591277056
    m_Key: I might need something sharp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95623907048738816
    m_Key: Nothing useful.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95623907078098944
    m_Key: Nothing useful here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95623907078098945
    m_Key: There's no fuse here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95623907078098946
    m_Key: No fuse in here either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95623907078098947
    m_Key: Still no fuse...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95623907078098948
    m_Key: Not here. Keep looking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95628046109560832
    m_Key: The door won't open.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 99703744835145728
    m_Key: I don't have time for that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 99722716024459264
    m_Key: It's locked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 99722716078985216
    m_Key: It's unlocked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101515578273746944
    m_Key: Does not open from this side
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213255114752
    m_Key: Don't shoot! Don't shoot! It wasn't me, I swear!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669184
    m_Key: ...Do what?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669185
    m_Key: There's so many of them with my face... but I'm not one of them! Please!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669186
    m_Key: You locked me in that store.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669187
    m_Key: No, no, no. That was one of them. Look, no knife.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669188
    m_Key: Who are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669189
    m_Key: Um...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669190
    m_Key: I'm Khalid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669191
    m_Key: ...Doesn't matter who I am.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669192
    m_Key: What happened here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669193
    m_Key: Nobody knows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669194
    m_Key: Don't read those out loud. Something always answers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669195
    m_Key: I'm looking for a boy. He had a backpack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669196
    m_Key: ...Is he yours?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669197
    m_Key: ...He's my brother.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669198
    m_Key: Then I hope you find him. He went toward the school.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669199
    m_Key: But don't go into the alley there. People go in. They don't come out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669200
    m_Key: I have to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669201
    m_Key: No. You don't.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669202
    m_Key: Move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669203
    m_Key: Can't you hear me?! I'm telling you, you'll die in there!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669204
    m_Key: Let go of me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669205
    m_Key: "For what?! For a kid who's probably already\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669206
    m_Key: Then I hope you find him. Where did you see him?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669207
    m_Key: In the alley by the school. I just came from there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669208
    m_Key: ...You went in there? And you came back out?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669209
    m_Key: Yeah.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669210
    m_Key: Nobody comes back out of there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669211
    m_Key: I did.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669212
    m_Key: ...Then something let you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669213
    m_Key: I'm going back. The boy went that way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669214
    m_Key: No. Whatever let you out won't do it twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669215
    m_Key: Can't you hear me?! You got lucky! You'll die in there!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669216
    m_Key: ...Fine. Go. Don't say I didn't warn you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102624213288669217
    m_Key: I can't stay here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103007775737303040
    m_Key: "Wait, wait! Don\u2019t shoot! Please, don\u2019t shoot!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103007775858937856
    m_Key: "It wasn\u2019t me! I swear on my life, it wasn\u2019t! There are other
      versions of me out there."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103007775858937857
    m_Key: "I don\u2019t know why! They all carry knives... they\u2019re ruining
      my reputation!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103007775858937858
    m_Key: ...Other versions?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103007775858937859
    m_Key: "Believe me! I\u2019ve got nothing to do with this!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103007775858937860
    m_Key: Alright... I believe you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103007775858937861
    m_Key: "Look, I\u2019m trying to help you. Come with me, we can double back to
      the main road."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103007775858937862
    m_Key: "It\u2019s safe that way. Let\u2019s just leave."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103007775858937863
    m_Key: "I\u2019m not leaving."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103007775863132160
    m_Key: Have you seen a kid with a blue backpack?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103007775863132161
    m_Key: "A blue backpack? ...Yeah. I think so. Through the fog, I couldn\u2019t
      see him well."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103007775863132162
    m_Key: Why? Who is he to you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103007775863132163
    m_Key: "He\u2019s my brother. Where did he go?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103007775863132164
    m_Key: "The alley by the school. But listen to me, you can\u2019t go after him!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103007775863132165
    m_Key: "I barely got out of there in one piece. Come with me instead, we can\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103007775863132166
    m_Key: Thanks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103007775863132167
    m_Key: "Wait! He went in there hours ago! He could already be\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103007775863132168
    m_Key: "HEY! I\u2019M TRYING TO SAVE YOUR LIFE!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103007775863132169
    m_Key: "You\u2019re insane..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103015062820409344
    m_Key: "It wasn\u2019t me! I swear on my life, it wasn\u2019t!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103015062845575168
    m_Key: There are other versions of me out there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103015062845575169
    m_Key: "I don\u2019t know why!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103015062845575170
    m_Key: "They all carry knives... they\u2019re ruining my reputation!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103015062845575171
    m_Key: "Look, I\u2019m trying to help you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103015062845575172
    m_Key: Come with me, we can double back to the main road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103015062845575173
    m_Key: A blue backpack? ...Yeah. I think so.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103015062845575174
    m_Key: "Through the fog, I couldn\u2019t see him well."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103015062845575175
    m_Key: The alley by the school.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103015062845575176
    m_Key: "But listen to me, you can\u2019t go after him!"
    m_Metadata:
